{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The heroine falls into a maze for some strange reason.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will operate the heroine to survive in this maze for 30 days before you have a chance to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >During the day, you can go into the maze to collect the supplies you need to survive.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you have to get back to the main base before dark!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The maze at night is unpredictable, and there will be scary monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865300/extras/35df84ef52a7d2ee8693ce5678063eb9.poster.avif?t=1759215973\" width=1170 height=660 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865300/extras/35df84ef52a7d2ee8693ce5678063eb9.webm?t=1759215973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865300/extras/35df84ef52a7d2ee8693ce5678063eb9.mp4?t=1759215973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In the maze, you may experience several different, fairy-tale worlds.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many countries in this fairy world, such as the kingdom of playing cards, baboon country, steam country and so on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865300/extras/2069257358b6b5b46d585eef550feda6.poster.avif?t=1759215973\" width=1170 height=650 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865300/extras/2069257358b6b5b46d585eef550feda6.webm?t=1759215973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865300/extras/2069257358b6b5b46d585eef550feda6.mp4?t=1759215973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nations are at war with each other and the world is on the verge of collapse...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the number of days you live increases, you will be able to travel to every country and discover the secrets hidden in every corner of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865300/extras/23ad4f9efce5a2554afc0882a66fbd36.poster.avif?t=1759215973\" width=1170 height=657 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865300/extras/23ad4f9efce5a2554afc0882a66fbd36.webm?t=1759215973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In order to survive, you can build some weapons or defensive towers to ward off monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, I recommend building some traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traps cooperate with each other, can form a platoon to contain monsters, causing higher damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a 2D style, survival and tower defense built survival game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865300/extras/4c1b7e8e2a75ac937311a0a9e0eddb71.avif?t=1759215973\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine dungeon and tower defense construction, become a trap master, and punch unexpected Combo.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2865300?t=1759215973","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/28653